    unsafe_capabilities_not_carried_into_hir_2026-08-21, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep-20261127: verified on fresh HEAD seed. Both parse lanes produce ExprKind.UnsafeBlock(body, caps) (parser_stmts.spl:733 direct, convert_nodes.spl:1414 flat bridge); HIR lowering expression_core.spl:2067-2083 validates names and assigns unsafe_hir_body.unsafe_caps on the HirBlock body (trailing field, hir_definitions.spl:879-882) - capability list rides into HIR with no variant-shape change; declaration form fills HirFunction.unsafe_reason/unsafe_caps keyed by flat decl index. Evidence: hir_function_unsafe_caps_spec 4/4 PASS, unsafe_block_capabilities_spec 9/9 PASS (statement + value position grants decided from the HIR node with an EMPTY profile; raw_ptr-only/typo caps not granted; bare unsafe: carries none), plus a 3/3 in-process probe. Residual follow-ups per doc: textual-grant AnyEscapeProfile path removal; native/Stage-3 confirmation of the HIR codec v15 bump pending (interpreter verified here). close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/compiler/semantics/any_escape/unsafe_block_capabilities_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/compiler/hir/hir_function_unsafe_caps_spec.spl"

